{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong> is a couch/online arcade action game where fearless pilots battling in chaotic aerial arenas across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just here to mess around with friends or to show off your next-level piloting skills, this game has room for both. The controls are easy to pick up, but mastering the skies? That\u2019s a whole different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/b3208e601ef38e4da5711e67eb753e73.poster.avif?t=1757530794\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/b3208e601ef38e4da5711e67eb753e73.webm?t=1757530794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/b3208e601ef38e4da5711e67eb753e73.mp4?t=1757530794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual fun or competitive flair \u2014 the choice is yours. Just don\u2019t expect anything to go as planned once you're <strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local/online multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique pilots &amp; flying machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ weapons: bullets, rockets, lasers, mines and other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 interactable arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible arcade-style controls with skill-based depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful, stylized world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for party nights <i>or</i> sweaty 1v1 grudge matches</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752960?t=1757530794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/007d12fa897666d898c7926ddc29de4adfc0ec7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757530794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/a3bf1cbe912e0336ee265a8c7bfde6eb0d13e5aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757530794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/a3bf1cbe912e0336ee265a8c7bfde6eb0d13e5aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757530794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong> is a couch/online arcade action game where fearless pilots battling in chaotic aerial arenas across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just here to mess around with friends or to show off your next-level piloting skills, this game has room for both. The controls are easy to pick up, but mastering the skies? That\u2019s a whole different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/b3208e601ef38e4da5711e67eb753e73.poster.avif?t=1757530794\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka